  "content": {
    "title": "开展“情暖环卫满春城.炎炎夏日送清凉”主题党日活动",
    "source": "中心党支部",
    "publishDate": "2021-08-18",
    "bodyHtml": "\n                    <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">&nbsp; &nbsp;为推进党史学习教育</span>“我为群众办实事”活动，<span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">8</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">月</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">18</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">日上午</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">点中心党支部与宾馆支部、经开环卫处联合开展“情暖环卫满春城</span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\">.</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">炎炎夏日送清凉”主题党日活动。全体党员及积极分子参加。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"474\" src=\"assets/1494ed97d8f312a2f064912ea90cf857cc11b3107d3d8f54b1f9847914bd056e.jpg\" width=\"632\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">&nbsp; &nbsp;党员同志们与环卫工人们一同沿着金川街（宾馆正门前路段）清理道路护栏卫生、打扫庭院周边绿化带卫生，助力疫情防控，打造宜居环境；普及垃圾分类小常识，共同提升居民文明素养；为环卫工人送去小风扇、饮料等慰问品，党群共建送温暖献爱心。</span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"249\" src=\"assets/56c25e9085cc05838ee0c579690ad7d047df856146513a1429fc602c74a70fd9.jpg\" width=\"332\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"249\" src=\"assets/c9587c587a43cac7b2a95e0bc13adffce563f775b1aea9531f566623786b49ce.jpg\" width=\"332\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">&nbsp; &nbsp;通过此次主题党日活动，密切了中心党支部与基层党组织、社区群众的沟通联络，进一步丰富</span> “我为群众办实事”活动内容，推动党史学习教育有效开展。</span></span></span></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"249\" src=\"assets/4132686002d93d56130bc76e025e877b0430b1019b0c1433e385ee9b5528e65c.jpg\" width=\"332\"></span></span></span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img alt=\"\" height=\"249\" src=\"assets/dfc2a580ff095c88a85112fbf2523c6a20675647d1cae7b999f3f6fa32315b53.jpg\" width=\"367\"></p>\n\n                ",
    "externalUrl": null
  },
